.TH SANCHALA-QUICKLOOK 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-quicklook \- macOS-style file preview
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-quicklook
[\fIcommand\fR] \fIfile\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Preview files quickly without opening full applications. Supports images, videos, audio, PDFs, text files, and more.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B preview \fIfile\fR
Preview the specified file
.TP
.B info \fIfile\fR
Show detailed file information
.SH SUPPORTED FORMATS
Images (PNG, JPG, GIF, SVG), Videos (MP4, MKV, AVI), Audio (MP3, FLAC, WAV), Documents (PDF, TXT, MD), Archives (ZIP, TAR)
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-quicklook photo.jpg
.TP
sanchala-quicklook info document.pdf
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
